        "question": "Can a spreadsheet handle partial payments and duplicates?",
        "answer": "It can, with lookups, sums, and careful conditional logic — but you build and re-verify that logic every period, and a single dragged formula can mislabel a whole column. A dedicated matcher treats partials and duplicates as first-class states rather than something you code around."
